  "description": "AI-assisted page building inside the Umbraco backoffice (Umbraco 17 and 18). Adds an \"AI Builder\" workspace action to Documents that assembles Block Grid pages from your existing components from a plain prompt or topic (optionally reproducing an attached design screenshot), rewrites a single block on demand, and fills every configured language variant from the source culture with preview and draft-only apply. Also translates Dictionary items and Media captions/alt text. Bring your own OpenAI-compatible LLM endpoint (OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Gemini, Groq, OpenRouter or a local Ollama). Ships with English and Vietnamese backoffice localizations.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
