  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v17.0.0 / v18.0.0: Initial release, shipped as two version lines — 17.x for Umbraco 17 and 18.x for Umbraco 18 — with each line's Umbraco dependency boxed to that one major, so an Umbraco 17 host always resolves the 17.x line. AI Builder workspace action for Documents (Build from prompt, single-block rewrite, Languages with variant alignment), Dictionary and Media translation, media sourcing from the existing library and optional AI image generation (off by default).",
